<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunfire hit a house in Culiacán tied to Governor Rocha Moya, wounding a man outside, while Mexican bishops are urging authorities to find a missing priest in Sinaloa. In Florida, a Sinaloa-linked cocaine pipeline using commercial trucks into Tampa Bay was dismantled, leading to racketeering charges against several suspects. In Oklahoma City, an 18-year-old was arrested after shooting a 25-year-old veteran outside a bank, and another 18-year-old was arrested on murder and robbery complaints related to a separate bank shooting. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KTLA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1VRGU2X09wSVpVLVR4MXMyODJlMnJkdmV1VlVwT0Q3bUc2RkwwcVVXQWIxOUxkLTlLb2NFbUlxbzhqZGdBamE3YWQ2QXFZN3hRbzZfeGo3MUxCU2RHM094YUNaS3gzR2FhaHlEMGlQUklSX1hfN1BmbDZUejdoUlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 11 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WWLP&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQaks5Um04c25NSE1CV2NmZ0JCVWxsVF9QQ1YxU3JxLWNZMDMxclYyQ3Bhb0pzdkw2X2lhaVNTYldHT2NheGplNlJpRDhSWXlFd1VscFJMVEdZTDNIQklocWdZcTVoX0NVMmdGWmFQNlU0VG0tRENsdy14LUlNV1lFaHg5M1VDdEdyTEFhZExiRU1nbnNWSW01R3BSNjNGUHZHelU2MzViTEVhejFkMHZobGswdmZMdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;KOKH&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxORTR0Si1VNnl0LUxlcVQtQl9YS1JPYThENFcybXN5a2hWR3Z3aUVEbG5lZFdzZUxXOC1XX01fWW5yWHB6Z2N1VDZXWHhrRDRCdDZkNDhub3QtWkZISXB1SVhZWVg5N1YwVFV2YUxPY1hVU0ota3ZWeHhuLXBQQWoxbUNGV3ZoVGZQN3gyU21rbnRyUnRsOGF6ZTJKVVlTVkh6Y3dHYVNYQnU2WUN2M2wxYUpORHU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Peninsula Qatar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQVDJfNU9JUlhmT19URHlNMk1